OL,3,GNEWSAParking rules and charges set to
OL,4,Achange next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to increase parking fees by
OL,7,FSomerset Council will now come into
OL,8,Fforce from January 2027.
OL,10,FThe plans were reviewed after concerns
OL,11,Ffrom the community and opposition
OL,12,Fparties that higher parking costs could
OL,13,Faffect businesses.
OL,15,FThe introduction of Sunday parking fees
OL,16,Fand a new county-wide tiered charging
OL,17,Fsystem will be phased in during the
OL,18,Fautumn of 2027.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
