OL,3,GNEWSAParking rules and charges set to
OL,4,Achange next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council says the changes will
OL,7,Fcreate a fairer and more consistent
OL,8,Fapproach but no decision has been made
OL,9,Fon charging at currently free car
OL,10,Fparks.
